{"seq":1,"slug":"reserve-confirm-release","title":"预占/确认扣减/释放三段状态","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/deduct-reserve/reserve-confirm-release","wordCount":2208,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"预占-确认扣减-释放三段状态\">预占/确认扣减/释放三段状态</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「下单」与「支付」之间的那段窗口是库存系统最大的不确定性来源。用户可能在 3 秒内付款，也可能把页面挂在后台两天；支付可能成功但回调丢失；用户可能已经付款却因为重复下单而取消其中一单。如果下单时就把库存真正扣掉，这段窗口内的所有异常都会表达为「库存已经减少但没有成交」，也就是库存虚少；如果下单时不扣，就等于把判断推迟到支付时刻，届时大量用户同时支付，超卖不可避免。</p>\n<p>三段式状态是解决这个矛盾的标准答案。它把一次交易对库存的影响拆成三个动作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>预占 <code>reserve</code></strong> — 下单时执行。<code>reserved += n</code>，<code>available -= n</code>。这是一个<strong>可撤销的承诺</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>确认扣减 <code>confirm</code></strong> — 支付成功时执行。<code>on_hand -= n</code>，<code>reserved -= n</code>。这是<strong>不可撤销的事实</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>释放 <code>release</code></strong> — 支付超时或用户取消时执行。<code>reserved -= n</code>，<code>available += n</code>。这是<strong>承诺的撤回</strong>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三段式的价值不在于它更精确，而在于它把「不确定」变成了一种有明确超时的显式状态。只要每一笔预占都有超时兜底，库存就不会永久失踪；只要确认扣减能正确处理「预占已失效」的情况，超卖就不会来自时序倒置。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Created: 提交订单&#10;    Created --&gt; Reserved: reserve 成功&#10;    Created --&gt; Failed: 库存不足&#10;    Reserved --&gt; Confirmed: confirm 支付成功&#10;    Reserved --&gt; Released: release 超时/取消&#10;    Released --&gt; Reacquired: 支付迟到 → 重新预占&#10;    Reacquired --&gt; Confirmed: confirm&#10;    Reacquired --&gt; Failed: 库存不足 → 转人工/退款&#10;    Confirmed --&gt; [*]&#10;    Failed --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Created: 提交订单\n    Created --&gt; Reserved: reserve 成功\n    Created --&gt; Failed: 库存不足\n    Reserved --&gt; Confirmed: confirm 支付成功\n    Reserved --&gt; Released: release 超时/取消\n    Released --&gt; Reacquired: 支付迟到 → 重新预占\n    Reacquired --&gt; Confirmed: confirm\n    Reacquired --&gt; Failed: 库存不足 → 转人工/退款\n    Confirmed --&gt; [*]\n    Failed --&gt; [*]</pre><p>注意图中多出的 <code>Reacquired</code> 状态：它对应「用户在释放之后才完成支付」。这是一个真实且高频的场景——释放任务的调度延迟与用户支付的网络延迟可能只差几百毫秒。系统必须显式处理它，而不是把它当成不可能事件。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动作</th>\n<th>on_hand</th>\n<th>reserved</th>\n<th>available</th>\n<th>幂等要求</th>\n<th>失败重试安全性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>reserve</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>+n</td>\n<td>−n</td>\n<td>必须（下单接口会重试）</td>\n<td>需幂等键，否则重复预占</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>confirm</td>\n<td>−n</td>\n<td>−n</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>必须（回调会重放）</td>\n<td>需幂等键，否则实物虚减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>release</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>−n</td>\n<td>+n</td>\n<td>必须（三路触发）</td>\n<td>需幂等键，否则可售虚增</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三个动作全部需要幂等键，这是本节最重要的结论。<strong>三段式状态本身不提供幂等性，它只是让幂等性变得可定义</strong>——有了明确的动作语义，才能为每个动作定义「同一笔业务只生效一次」的判定条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三条实现路线\">三条实现路线</h2><p>三段式的语义是固定的，实现方式有三种，选择取决于并发量与基础设施。</p>\n<p><strong>路线一：预占就是数据库行。</strong> 下单时在 <code>inventory_reservation</code> 表插入一行，<code>confirm</code> 时把这行标记为已确认并更新库存主表，<code>release</code> 时标记为已释放。库存主表的 <code>reserved</code> 由这些行的汇总维护（实时维护或定时重算）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE inventory_reservation (&#10;  reservation_id VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL,&#10;  sku_id         BIGINT       NOT NULL,&#10;  warehouse_id   INT          NOT NULL,&#10;  quantity       INT          NOT NULL,&#10;  status         ENUM(&#39;RESERVED&#39;,&#39;CONFIRMED&#39;,&#39;RELEASED&#39;) NOT NULL,&#10;  order_no       VARCHAR(64)  NOT NULL,&#10;  expire_at      DATETIME(3)  NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at     DATETIME(3)  NOT NULL,&#10;  updated_at     DATETIME(3)  NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (reservation_id),&#10;  UNIQUE KEY uk_order_sku_wh (order_no, sku_id, warehouse_id),&#10;  KEY idx_status_expire (status, expire_at)&#10;) ENGINE=InnoDB;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inventory_reservation</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  reservation_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  warehouse_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  quantity       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">         ENUM(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RESERVED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CONFIRMED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  expire_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (reservation_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uk_order_sku_wh (order_no, sku_id, warehouse_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> idx_status_expire (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, expire_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ENGINE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">InnoDB;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>uk_order_sku_wh</code> 是幂等的实现基础：重复的下单请求会因唯一键冲突而失败，而不是重复预占。<code>idx_status_expire</code> 支撑释放调度器的扫描。路线一的优点是全在数据库事务内、对账最容易、无需额外中间件；缺点是每次预占都要写行并更新主表行锁，QPS 上限受单行锁限制（见 <a href=\"../concurrency-cache/hot-sku-deduction\">热点 SKU 分桶扣减与合并</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>路线二：Redis 承载预占，数据库记录结果。</strong> 预占在 Redis 上以原子命令完成并写入一条带 TTL 的占位记录，TTL 到期即自动释放，数据库异步落库。Redis 保证脚本的原子执行——脚本运行期间会阻塞整个服务器的所有活动（来源：Redis Docs — Scripting with Lua, <a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/develop/programmability/eval-intro/）；但\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/develop/programmability/eval-intro/）；但</a> Redis 的 key 过期是「被动删除 + 定期抽样主动删除」的混合策略，因此过期事件不保证准时送达（来源：Redis Docs — EXPIRE: How Redis expires keys, <a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/expire/）。\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/commands/expire/）。</a></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"lua\" data-code=\"-- KEYS[1] = inv:{sku}:{wh}:available&#10;-- KEYS[2] = inv:{sku}:{wh}:reserved&#10;-- KEYS[3] = reserve:{reservationId}&#10;-- ARGV[1] = quantity  ARGV[2] = ttlSeconds&#10;local avail = tonumber(redis.call(&#39;GET&#39;, KEYS[1]) or &#39;-1&#39;)&#10;if avail &lt; 0 then return -2 end&#10;if avail &lt; tonumber(ARGV[1]) then return -1 end&#10;redis.call(&#39;DECRBY&#39;, KEYS[1], ARGV[1])&#10;redis.call(&#39;INCRBY&#39;, KEYS[2], ARGV[1])&#10;redis.call(&#39;SET&#39;, KEYS[3], ARGV[1], &#39;EX&#39;, ARGV[2])&#10;return avail - tonumber(ARGV[1])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>-- KEYS[1] = inv:{sku}:{wh}:available</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- KEYS[2] = inv:{sku}:{wh}:reserved</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- KEYS[3] = reserve:{reservationId}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>-- ARGV[1] = quantity  ARGV[2] = ttlSeconds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>local avail = tonumber(redis.call('GET', KEYS[1]) or '-1')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if avail &#x3C; 0 then return -2 end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>if avail &#x3C; tonumber(ARGV[1]) then return -1 end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('DECRBY', KEYS[1], ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('INCRBY', KEYS[2], ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>redis.call('SET', KEYS[3], ARGV[1], 'EX', ARGV[2])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>return avail - tonumber(ARGV[1])</span></span></code></pre></div><p>路线二的好处是把超时释放交给了 Redis 的 TTL 机制，不需要自己的调度器去扫表；代价是 Redis 成为真相源，一旦它没持久化就重启，所有 TTL 占位记录都会消失，而数据库里的预占还挂着（默认 RDB 快照策略下，Redis 异常停止可能丢失最近数分钟的数据；AOF 的默认 <code>appendfsync everysec</code> 也会丢失最多一秒的写入，来源：Redis Docs — Redis persistence, <a href=\"https://redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/management/persistence/）。所以路线二必须配一个「以\">https://redis.io/docs/latest/operate/oss_and_stack/management/persistence/）。所以路线二必须配一个「以</a> Redis 为准重建预占」或「以数据库为准回灌 Redis」的对齐流程（见 <a href=\"../concurrency-cache/cache-db-consistency\">Redis 缓存与 DB 库存对账</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>路线三：混合。</strong> Redis 做预占与超时，数据库做最终账。确认扣减时先落库再清 Redis，中间用消息保证最终一致。这是大促场景最常用的形态，也是复杂度最高的。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>路线一（纯 DB）</th>\n<th>路线二（Redis 为主）</th>\n<th>路线三（混合）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>预占吞吐</td>\n<td>受单行锁限制，千级 QPS</td>\n<td>万级 QPS</td>\n<td>万级 QPS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时释放</td>\n<td>需自建调度器</td>\n<td>依赖 TTL，天然</td>\n<td>TTL + 兜底扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>崩溃恢复</td>\n<td>天然安全</td>\n<td>需重建流程</td>\n<td>需重建流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对账复杂度</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>日常、预售、高价值商品</td>\n<td>秒杀、发券类</td>\n<td>大促全场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选择的关键问题不是「哪个快」，而是「团队能否承担崩溃恢复的复杂度」。路线二与三在正常路径上都很干净，复杂度几乎全部集中在故障路径上，而那正是最不容易被测试覆盖的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"确认扣减的正确写法\">确认扣减的正确写法</h2><p><code>confirm</code> 是整个链路里最容易写错的一步。错误写法与正确写法的差别只有几行，但后果相反。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 错误：确认时再扣一次可售&#10;UPDATE inventory SET available = available - 1&#10;WHERE sku_id = ? AND warehouse_id = ? AND available &gt;= 1;&#10;&#10;-- 正确：出库时实物与预占同时减少，可售不变&#10;UPDATE inventory SET on_hand = on_hand - 1, reserved = reserved - 1&#10;WHERE sku_id = ? AND warehouse_id = ? AND reserved &gt;= 1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 错误：确认时再扣一次可售</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 正确：出库时实物与预占同时减少，可售不变</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_hand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> on_hand </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reserved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>错误写法在单笔业务上看起来也「对」——库存确实减少了。但它在两处崩掉：一是 <code>available</code> 被扣了两次（预占时一次、确认时一次），库存虚少一半；二是不知道为什么减少，运营无法区分「卖掉了」与「占住了」。正确写法里 <code>WHERE reserved &gt;= 1</code> 是必要的保护：如果预占已被释放，这个更新会命中 0 行，此时必须走 <code>Reacquired</code> 分支（重新预占或转人工），而不是硬扣。</p>\n<p>确认扣减还必须处理「部分履约」：一个订单 3 件，仓库只发了 2 件。此时要么拆成两个确认动作（2 件确认、1 件释放），要么允许 <code>confirm</code> 携带数量并让 <code>reserved</code> 保留余量。整单确认的设计无法表达部分履约，会在实际运营中被迫做数据订正。</p>\n<h2 id=\"释放的三种触发路径与竞争\">释放的三种触发路径与竞争</h2><p>释放被三条路径触发，它们可能同时到达：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>超时调度器</strong> — 扫描 <code>status = RESERVED AND expire_at &lt; now()</code> 的记录。</li>\n<li><strong>用户取消</strong> — 用户主动点击取消订单。</li>\n<li><strong>支付失败/关单</strong> — 支付超时或渠道返回失败后，订单系统关单并通知库存释放。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>三条路径必须共享同一个幂等键（通常是 <code>reservation_id</code>），并且释放动作必须用条件更新而不是先读后写：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"UPDATE inventory_reservation&#10;SET status = &#39;RELEASED&#39;, updated_at = NOW(3)&#10;WHERE reservation_id = ? AND status = &#39;RESERVED&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 只有影响 1 行时才执行库存归还&#10;UPDATE inventory SET reserved = reserved - ?&#10;WHERE sku_id = ? AND warehouse_id = ? AND reserved &gt;= ?;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory_reservation</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, updated_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reservation_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RESERVED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 只有影响 1 行时才执行库存归还</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> inventory </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sku_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> warehouse_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ? </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> reserved </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ?;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第一步的条件更新是幂等的核心：只有第一个到达的触发者能把 <code>RESERVED</code> 改成 <code>RELEASED</code>，后续触发者影响 0 行，因而不会重复归还。这两步必须在同一事务内，否则第一步成功、第二步失败会造成「状态已释放但库存没还」——一个永久泄漏的额度。</p>\n<p>释放与确认的竞争是本章最需要显式测试的场景：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant S as 释放调度器&#10;    participant DB as 数据库&#10;    participant P as 支付回调&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE reservation SET RELEASED WHERE status=RESERVED&#10;    DB--&gt;&gt;S: 影响 1 行(抢到)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE inventory SET reserved -= 1&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT reservation FOR UPDATE&#10;    DB--&gt;&gt;P: status = RELEASED&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;P: 走 Reacquired 分支:尝试重新预占&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;DB: 重新预占成功 → 置为 CONFIRMED\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant S as 释放调度器\n    participant DB as 数据库\n    participant P as 支付回调\n    S-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE reservation SET RELEASED WHERE status=RESERVED\n    DB--&gt;&gt;S: 影响 1 行(抢到)\n    S-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE inventory SET reserved -= 1\n    P-&gt;&gt;DB: SELECT reservation FOR UPDATE\n    DB--&gt;&gt;P: status = RELEASED\n    P-&gt;&gt;P: 走 Reacquired 分支:尝试重新预占\n    P-&gt;&gt;DB: 重新预占成功 → 置为 CONFIRMED</pre><p>反之若支付先到，调度器会读到 <code>CONFIRMED</code> 并跳过。两种顺序都能得到一致结果，前提是<strong>确认路径必须把「预占已释放」当作一个正常分支而不是异常</strong>。把它当异常的团队会在日志里看到大量报错，然后在压力下把这段逻辑删掉，最终形成超卖。</p>\n<p>详细的释放调度设计（延迟消息 vs 定时扫描、精度与兜底）见 <a href=\"timeout-release\">超时未支付库存释放</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>三段式状态把「下单到支付」的不确定窗口变成显式的、有超时的预占，是防超卖的结构性前提。</li>\n<li><code>reserve</code>、<code>confirm</code>、<code>release</code> 三个动作全部需要幂等键；三段式本身不提供幂等性，它只是让幂等性可定义。</li>\n<li><code>confirm</code> 的正确语义是 <code>on_hand -= n, reserved -= n</code>，可售量不变；写成「再扣一次可售」是库存虚少的头号原因。</li>\n<li>释放有三条触发路径（超时、取消、关单），必须共享幂等键并用条件更新保证只有第一个生效。</li>\n<li>「支付迟到、预占已被释放」是高频正常场景，必须有 <code>Reacquired</code> 分支；把它当异常会导致这段保护逻辑被删掉。</li>\n<li>三条实现路线（纯 DB / Redis 为主 / 混合）的复杂度差异几乎全在故障恢复上，选型应按团队的对账能力而非峰值吞吐决定。</li>\n<li>下一步：各条路线的具体原子写法与失败模式，见 <a href=\"oversell-defense\">防超卖：DB 条件更新 vs Redis 原子扣减</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预占/确认扣减/释放三段状态","id":"预占-确认扣减-释放三段状态"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三条实现路线","id":"三条实现路线"},{"level":2,"text":"确认扣减的正确写法","id":"确认扣减的正确写法"},{"level":2,"text":"释放的三种触发路径与竞争","id":"释放的三种触发路径与竞争"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"SKU 与分仓/渠道库存模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/inventory-model/sku-warehouse-model"},"next":{"title":"防超卖：DB 条件更新 vs Redis 原子扣减","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/inventory-reservation-fulfillment/deduct-reserve/oversell-defense"}}